1239
01:49:54,875 --> 01:49:58,416
<i>dan menjelajahi dunia dengannya.</i>

1240
01:50:03,750 --> 01:50:05,791
<i>Si Anjing Tua berjanji kepada gadis itu,</i>

1241
01:50:06,416 --> 01:50:08,583
<i>"Sampai salju turun di Tailan,</i>

1242
01:50:08,666 --> 01:50:10,583
<i>aku takkan pernah meninggalkanmu."</i>

1243
01:50:20,166 --> 01:50:21,458
- Sudah?
- Tunggu.

1244
01:50:21,541 --> 01:50:23,333
- Oke?
- Oke.

1245
01:50:23,416 --> 01:50:24,916
Tenang, Hima.

1246
01:50:25,666 --> 01:50:27,416
Ayo bertualang!

1247
01:50:28,375 --> 01:50:29,208
Tentu!

1248
01:50:29,291 --> 01:50:31,666
Harapanmu terkabul.

1249
01:50:31,750 --> 01:50:34,708
- Kau yakin soal itu?
- Kita bisa pergi tiap bulan.

1250
01:51:17,541 --> 01:51:18,708
Bagus, Hima.

1251
01:51:21,708 --> 01:51:23,041
Dia sudah memercayaiku.

1252
01:51:24,416 --> 01:51:25,625
Kau tak perlu cemas lagi.

1253
01:51:27,583 --> 01:51:28,583
Pintar.

1254
01:51:29,583 --> 01:51:30,583
Pemimpin kawanan.

1255
01:51:37,958 --> 01:51:39,500
Aku pemimpin kawanan sekarang.

1256
01:51:49,250 --> 01:51:51,958
Sayang sekali
waktu kita dengannya amat singkat.

1257
01:51:57,625 --> 01:52:00,541
Tiga bulan
mungkin terasa lama bagi anjing.

1258
01:52:01,333 --> 01:52:04,375
Waktu manusia dan anjing itu berbeda.

1259
01:52:06,583 --> 01:52:09,416
Anjing lebih baik
dalam mengingat detail tertentu.

1260
01:52:10,666 --> 01:52:12,958
Saat dia diperlakukan baik,

1261
01:52:13,041 --> 01:52:15,541
waktu akan menjadi lambat.

1262
01:52:16,875 --> 01:52:17,875
Pantas saja.

1263
01:52:19,791 --> 01:52:21,375
Sejak kau kembali…

1264
01:52:23,458 --> 01:52:25,291
waktu hampir tak berjalan.

1265
01:52:30,625 --> 01:52:33,000
Mungkin aku berubah jadi anjing.

1266
01:52:41,625 --> 01:52:42,875
Menurutmu…

1267
01:52:44,750 --> 01:52:45,875
dia bermimpi apa?

1268
01:52:48,375 --> 01:52:49,583
Kau sungguh bermimpi?

1269
01:53:04,041 --> 01:53:05,041
Pelé.

1270
01:53:14,250 --> 01:53:15,250
Jaidee!

1271
01:53:16,583 --> 01:53:18,375
Aku mau pergi ke pantai.

1272
01:53:20,291 --> 01:53:22,125
Bawa aku ke pantai, Ibu!

1273
01:53:22,708 --> 01:53:23,791
Oke.

1274
01:53:23,875 --> 01:53:25,333
Jika Hima ingin pergi,

1275
01:53:26,125 --> 01:53:27,166
kenapa tidak?

1276
01:53:33,125 --> 01:53:35,083
- Lihat ke kamera.
- Senyum ke kamera!

1277
01:53:35,166 --> 01:53:37,583
- Satu, dua, tiga.
- Lihat.

1278
01:53:38,958 --> 01:53:42,000
Senyum, Pak Tua! Kita sedang berlibur.

1279
01:53:42,875 --> 01:53:44,958
- Ayo ke pantai hari ini.
- Bakso?

1280
01:53:46,541 --> 01:53:47,875
- Bakso?
- Beli satai.

1281
01:53:47,958 --> 01:53:50,416
Mau bakso, Hima?

1282
01:53:51,708 --> 01:53:53,791
Dia boleh makan itu?

1283
01:53:54,750 --> 01:53:55,791
Itu asin.

1284
01:53:58,916 --> 01:54:00,250
Ayolah, Pelé!

1285
01:54:00,333 --> 01:54:01,500
Sudah tidak.

1286
01:54:03,166 --> 01:54:04,375
Ayo!

1287
01:54:04,458 --> 01:54:07,375
Siapa yang mau makan itu, 'kan?

1288
01:54:12,583 --> 01:54:14,166
Cepat! Matahari akan terbenam.

1289
01:54:15,833 --> 01:54:19,208
- Lihat lautnya, Hima.
- Ini dia!

1290
01:54:19,875 --> 01:54:21,208
Kali pertama, ya?

1291
01:54:22,791 --> 01:54:23,750
Cantik, 'kan?

1292
01:54:37,125 --> 01:54:38,583
Hima, tunggu!

1293
01:54:43,333 --> 01:54:45,166
- Tunggu!
- Hei!

1294
01:54:46,208 --> 01:54:47,208
Hima!

1295
01:54:48,083 --> 01:54:49,208
Tunggu aku!

1296
01:54:52,916 --> 01:54:53,958
Bagaimana?

1297
01:54:57,625 --> 01:55:01,250
- Kita harus jalan ke sini lain kali.
- Aku pernah bermain ini di rumah.

1298
01:55:01,333 --> 01:55:04,000
Dia kelelahan.

1299
01:55:04,083 --> 01:55:05,750
Tidur nyenyak.

1300
01:55:18,166 --> 01:55:19,083
Jaidee.

1301
01:55:24,000 --> 01:55:26,541
Kau bilang Hima suka bermimpi.

1302
01:55:27,375 --> 01:55:30,083
- Kurasa aku tahu mimpinya.
- Apa?

1303
01:55:49,625 --> 01:55:52,041
PELÉ & JAIDEE SELAMANYA!

1304
01:55:52,125 --> 01:55:53,291
Dia bermimpi…

1305
01:55:56,083 --> 01:55:57,708
tinggal bersama kita selamanya.

1306
01:56:05,458 --> 01:56:06,583
Jaidee.

1307
01:56:12,041 --> 01:56:13,000
Mau…

1308
01:56:15,791 --> 01:56:17,166
tinggal bersama sungguhan?

1309
01:56:35,833 --> 01:56:37,583
Selain karena Hima…

1310
01:56:40,125 --> 01:56:41,541
aku kembali…

1311
01:56:44,916 --> 01:56:46,333
karena mencemaskanmu.

1312
01:56:51,750 --> 01:56:53,416
Tapi entah apa kau sadar.

1313
01:56:59,208 --> 01:57:01,750
Aku sudah punya pacar sekarang.

1314
01:57:09,708 --> 01:57:11,250
Sepertinya…

1315
01:57:13,458 --> 01:57:14,958
begitu Hima tiada…

1316
01:57:18,125 --> 01:57:19,916
kita mungkin takkan bertemu lagi.

1317
01:57:29,000 --> 01:57:30,958
Tapi aku tak membencimu.

1318
01:57:35,208 --> 01:57:36,208
Aku hanya…

1319
01:57:38,500 --> 01:57:40,125
tak mau orang itu menunggu.

1320
01:57:50,541 --> 01:57:51,416
Hei.

1321
01:57:53,125 --> 01:57:54,125
Aku mengerti.

1322
01:58:02,875 --> 01:58:07,666
HIMA

1323
01:59:01,375 --> 01:59:04,291
Hima, kau belum diinfus.

1324
01:59:04,375 --> 01:59:05,833
Ayo infus dulu.

1325
01:59:12,458 --> 01:59:13,666
Sebentar.

1326
01:59:49,000 --> 01:59:51,541
Kenapa aku memberimu ini?

1327
01:59:53,208 --> 01:59:54,833
Kau tetap akan mati.

1328
02:00:06,958 --> 02:00:07,875
Hima.

1329
02:00:10,708 --> 02:00:12,666
Bisakah kau hidup lebih lama?

1330
02:00:28,208 --> 02:00:29,083
Hima.

1331
02:00:35,375 --> 02:00:37,208
Bisakah kau tak mati?

1332
02:00:43,083 --> 02:00:45,375
Aku tak punya siapa-siapa lagi.

1333
02:01:13,583 --> 02:01:17,083
PELÉ & JAIDEE SELAMANYA!

1334
02:02:14,041 --> 02:02:15,375
Belum tidur?

1335
02:02:34,625 --> 02:02:36,041
Maaf.

1336
02:02:39,500 --> 02:02:41,166
Mulai sekarang…

1337
02:02:43,250 --> 02:02:46,208
aku takkan menemuimu dan Hima lagi.

1338
02:03:01,041 --> 02:03:03,583
Jika aku terus menemui kalian,

1339
02:03:07,125 --> 02:03:09,666
aku mungkin akan mencintaimu lagi.

1340
02:03:16,416 --> 02:03:17,416
Tak apa.

1341
02:03:20,791 --> 02:03:21,791
Pergilah.

1342
02:03:26,375 --> 02:03:29,208
Aku berjanji
akan merawat Hima sebaik mungkin.

1343
02:03:32,833 --> 02:03:35,750
Agar dia hidup selama mungkin.

1344
02:04:27,958 --> 02:04:32,000
3 BULAN

1345
02:05:04,125 --> 02:05:05,166
Apa yang kau baca?

1346
02:05:05,250 --> 02:05:06,666
Aku menghitung kepingan salju.

1347
02:05:08,583 --> 02:05:10,750
Katanya,

1348
02:05:10,833 --> 02:05:14,708
"Anjing Tua berjanji kepada gadis itu,

1349
02:05:15,375 --> 02:05:17,916
'Sampai salju turun di Tailan,

1350
02:05:18,000 --> 02:05:20,291
aku takkan pernah meninggalkanmu.'"

1351
02:05:22,208 --> 02:05:25,125
{\an8}Ibuku bilang
salju tak pernah turun di Tailan.

1352
02:05:25,208 --> 02:05:28,458
Artinya anjing ini takkan mati?

1353
02:05:38,958 --> 02:05:39,875
Hima!

1354
02:05:50,708 --> 02:05:51,791
Sini.

1355
02:05:52,458 --> 02:05:56,291
12 BULAN

1356
02:06:07,041 --> 02:06:09,708
Kau jauh lebih keren aslinya.

1357
02:06:24,208 --> 02:06:25,750
Ayo hidup tahun ini juga.

1358
02:06:26,375 --> 02:06:30,000
{\an8}MALAM TAHUN BARU PUTIH,
SUHU TURUN DI BAWAH NOL DERAJAT

1359
02:07:03,583 --> 02:07:05,500
Kau anjing yang tangguh.

1360
02:07:13,291 --> 02:07:14,416
Lelah?

1361
02:07:22,666 --> 02:07:24,875
Pejamkan matamu sepuluh menit.

1362
02:07:33,000 --> 02:07:34,458
Tapi jika kurang…

1363
02:07:40,375 --> 02:07:41,958
kau bisa tidur saja.

1364
02:08:48,833 --> 02:08:50,666
Kau mau membawaku ke mana, Hima?

1365
02:09:15,041 --> 02:09:16,666
Gohan!

1366
02:09:18,375 --> 02:09:20,583
Terima kasih!

1367
02:09:24,458 --> 02:09:26,500
Kau sudah dewasa.

1368
02:09:27,166 --> 02:09:30,083
Kau takkan muat di kotak ini lagi.

1369
02:09:44,166 --> 02:09:45,166
Brownie.

1370
02:09:48,208 --> 02:09:49,958
Kau hebat.

1371
02:09:51,541 --> 02:09:53,375
Kau sudah berusaha keras.

1372
02:10:08,250 --> 02:10:10,000
- Hima!
- Hima!

1373
02:10:10,083 --> 02:10:11,916
Sini, Hima!

1374
02:10:12,000 --> 02:10:15,583
- Sini, Hima!
- Hima!

1375
02:10:15,666 --> 02:10:16,583
Hima!

1376
02:10:18,250 --> 02:10:20,083
Aku sangat merindukanmu.

1377
02:10:20,166 --> 02:10:21,250
Pelé!

1378
02:10:40,958 --> 02:10:44,208
PINTU NAIK: PERON TINGGI

1379
02:11:11,583 --> 02:11:12,666
Aku harus pergi.

1380
02:12:05,958 --> 02:12:07,250
Terima kasih, Hima!

1381
02:12:11,791 --> 02:12:14,666
Waktu menjadi lambat saat aku bersamamu!

1382
02:12:17,708 --> 02:12:19,875
Aku ingin bersamamu selamanya, Hima!

1383
02:13:03,458 --> 02:13:07,333
{\an8}SAMPAI SALJU TURUN DI TAILAN,
AKU TAKKAN PERNAH MENINGGALKANMU

1384
02:13:31,833 --> 02:13:32,750
Kau sudah bangun?

1385
02:13:35,000 --> 02:13:37,250
Kau bermimpi apa?

1386
02:13:50,166 --> 02:13:51,666
Sampai salju turun, 'kan?

1387
02:14:06,041 --> 02:14:10,500
UNTUK SEMUA "ANJING TELANTAR"
DI LUAR SANA.

1388
02:20:08,541 --> 02:20:10,666
TAK ADA HEWAN YANG DISAKITI
SELAMA PRODUKSI.

1389
02:20:10,750 --> 02:20:13,500
SEMUA ADEGAN HEWAN DIREKAM
DENGAN PENGAWASAN PROFESIONAL.

1390
02:20:23,541 --> 02:20:28,458
Terjemahan subtitle oleh Sarah